window.products.push({"id":270170,"name":"Fancyarn Capsule Coffee Table - Modern Coffee Table with Storage, 100% Natural Oak Wood Coffee Table with Drawers, Simple Assembly, Oval Coffee Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qwdtqlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% Natural Oak Wood] The material of this modern coffee table is excellent 100% natural oak. The oak material of the coffee table is certified by the state, and its quality is enough to amaze you. When you touch this wooden coffee table, you can feel the softness and smoothness from solid wood. This is not the experience that other coffee tables with veneers can bring. This tea table can be safely used in the kid's room. You can study and play games with your children on this coffee table [Firm & Stable] The surface top of the oval coffee table is made of solid oak wood. NOT PIECED. NO VENEERS. This modern coffee table for living room is very firm and stable. The maximum weight of this coffee table is 300 lbs. The living room table can hold your daily necessities. It is also a good choice to use this coffee table as an office desk in the living room. The huge surface of the living room table can easily place your laptop, your documents, and materials [Simple Assembly in 5 Mins] The assembly of this coffee table is very simple. A person can easily assemble this coffee table alone. All you need to do is put the leg of the coffee table in the right position and screw it together with the coffee table. All the tools you need to install the coffee table are in the package of the coffee table, including hey key and screws. Instructions for installing the coffee table are also in the package, which guides how to install the coffee table correctly [Storage Drawers] This beautiful coffee table has 2 drawers for storage. You can put your small items in the drawers of the coffee table. The drawers of the coffee table are very practical, which gives you more space to sort out your belongings and prevents the coffee table from looking too messy. These 2 drawers of the coffee tables are also made of a complete piece of wood. You will be surprised at the exquisite workmanship of the whole coffee table with storage [Modern Design & Ideal Size] This wood coffee table has rounded corners, and the oval design of coffee table looks simple and modern. Because the coffee table is made of wood, the coffee table has a farmhouse and rustic style. The size of the coffee table is 22\"D x 47\"W x 17\"H which is ideal for all kinds of rooms. You can put this coffee table in the living room and use the coffee table as a dining table. You can also put many items on the coffee table, such as books, decor, coasters, and trays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qwdtqlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fancyarn","source_asin":"B0BXLNWGHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXLNWGHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXLNWGHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":270171,"name":"Polish Pottery Rectangular Baker 10-inch made by Ceramika Artystyczna (Maraschino)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Md27oRC4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Rectangular Baker 10-inch Maraschino Dimensions: 7¼\" wide, 9¾\" long, 2½\" high Capacity: 35oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Md27oRC4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B06XDF796Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XDF796Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XDF796Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
