window.products.push({"id":270193,"name":"MGGi 5 Set Ravioli Stamp Cutter,Large Round,Small Round,Square,Heart Shape Ravioli Maker & Dough Wheel Cutter,Metal Pasta Stamp Press Mold - for Ravio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yTlEsGJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ravioli maker stamp and pasta wheel cutter set is ideal tool for authentic homemade ravioli.Design round square triangles hearts or any shape follow your minds.Perfect for homemade meat, cheese or vegetable ravioli, pasta, dumplings lasagna, pierogies, wonton, tortellini, pastry, biscuits, noodles.Enjoy the traditional food in easy motion. Ravioli stamp Cutter package includes 1 square Cutter 2 round cutters and 1 roll wheel Cutter Made of food grade aluminium, sturdy and eco friendly,Comfortable wooden handle, less pain stress Not Glued Pasta Anymore! Make authentic homemade Italian ravioli at home with the Ravioli Cutter Stamp Set in brass and wood with fluted edges. Wooden handle provides comfortable and secure grip for less hand strain. Quick and Easy to Use! Nothing will be better than homemade pasta and uniformly sized ravioli for tasting. It makes the perfect gift for both amateur and experienced pasta makers, pasta lovers, and cooking enthusiasts! Versatile and Safe Use! These cutter stamps can used for ravioli and cookies. Aluminum design of the edge gives you the safety you need while making the cuts. Multiple Set Choice Round shape: 2.6inch (6.5cm) / 2 inch(5cm) Square shape: 2.8inch (7cm) Heart shape: 2.4inch (6.0cm) Roll wheel cutter: 5.1inch height How to use it? Step 1:Prepare and place the ravioli filling directed by the recipe. Put your favorite fillings of meat or vegetables inside them. (With meat, vegetable, or cheese filling, etc.) Step 2:Press downward firmly with the ravioli stamp set or roll wheel to cut the dough and seal the stuffing inside. Step 3:Molded in any fashion you prefer. Finish your own homemade ravioli!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yTlEsGJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MGGi","source_asin":"B08DLV96RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DLV96RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DLV96RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
