window.products.push({"id":270252,"name":"South Shore Bebble Bunk Bed, Twin, Charcoal Gray and Exotic Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810lXGqiONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- A great way to sleep two! -Your kids ? boys or girls ? will just love these bunk beds! They?ll spend a lot of time here, and make this bed their own little nook for sharing stories. - A modern Scandinavian design -This two-tone piece, in neutral colors with straight lines, was inspired by the Nordic style. The small openings in the panels, which act as guardrails, are just one of many features that give it a lightweight look even though it?s tall. - Super-safe bunk beds for kids -The angled ladder, guardrails, and wood and MDF structure all work together to make this piece safe for kids? and it?s ASTM certified. We recommend the use of a mattress no more than 9 inches thick for these beds. - Convertible bunk beds -You can also take the two beds apart ? and make them into a single bed and a smaller one that?ll make a great transition bed if you?re expecting a third child. This means you can reuse the lower bed later as a standard single bed in the room. - 1-year limited guarantee -South Shore is proud to stand behind this modern bunk beds with an exclusive 1-year limited guarantee. Shop with confidence knowing your purchase is always covered. South Shore beds can support a weight capacity of 250 lb for a twin size bed and 500 lb for a full, queen and king size bed . All our products meets or exceeds North American safety standards and our packaging are tested and certified to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. This item is shipped in 2 boxes, make sure to have a friend with you. Assembly is required by 2 adults and tools are not included. If you have questions regarding this product or need assistance do not hesitate to contact South Shore Furniture 7 days support. This product is made in Malaysia for South Shore with 100% solid wood and MDF. Mattress and accessories not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810lXGqiONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B09CZTBRBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CZTBRBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CZTBRBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
