window.products.push({"id":270390,"name":"Shappy Curtain Wire with Self-adhesive Hooks, Hooks and Eyes for Net Curtain Rod (3 Meters, 4 Pairs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YywCUw4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shappy 3 meterseter curtain wire with 6 pack self-adhesive hooks, 4 pairs of hooks and eyes for net curtain rodsUsages:The complete curtain accessories are suitable for both wood windows and metal windows; You can use the self-adhesive hooks on metal windows.Product description: Curtain wire length: 3 meters/ 10 feet Curtain wire diameter: 4 mm/ 0.16 inch Curtain wire color: white Function: hanging curtains and voiles Note:Before installing the hook, make sure the surface is clean and dry; Press and hold the hook for a minute in order to make sure the hook sticks tightly, recommend to hang the object on the hook after 24 hours; Please don't install the hook on painted wall and it is not removable.Warm notes:1. These plastic adhesive hooks are small parts; Please do not place too heavy things on them.2. To prevent the screws and hooks from falling off, the hooks and eyes cannot be screwed out directly from the curtain wire.3. If you want to change the length of the wire, please kindly cut the wire to adjust.Easy installation:You just need to screw the eye into the curtain wire, screw the hook into the wall or adhesion hook on the wall, attach eyes to the hooks on either side of the wire.Package includes: 1 x 3 meterseter curtain wire 4 x Eyes 4 x Hooks 6 x Self-adhesive hooksNotice: Because this item contains functional tapering points, please keep it away from children and babies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YywCUw4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shappy","source_asin":"B075LHFBVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075LHFBVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075LHFBVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
