window.products.push({"id":270531,"name":"Zulay Kitchen Non-Scratch Potato Masher Kitchen Tool - Durable Stainless Steel Wrapped In Premium Silicone Mashed Potatoes Masher - Versatile Masher H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JyLlPMJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Masher For Expensive Cookware: Our premium stainless steel potato masher comes with a thick, protective, silicone coat allowing you to use it directly with noon-stick cookware and fully meet your potato mashing expectations. Durable silicone coating makes sure you always get smooth and fluffy potato mash while keeping your favorite pots and pans secure and scratch-free. Superb & Durable Design: The beautiful and effective design makes this masher the perfect addition to your kitchen. The thick and durable stainless steel head, covered with premium, food-grade silicone is designed to mash directly inside your favorite pots and pans while protecting your expensive cookware from scratches and give you quality use for years to come. It measures 9.3\" in length while the handle measures 4.4\" x 1.0\". Durable And Easy To Use: The sturdy and perfectly balanced handle gives you the best grip for ultimate comfort and performance.  Made from high-quality, durable materials it mashes with no flexing or bending. If you are looking for a classic, reliable potato masher, this is the perfect choice for you. Very Easy To Clean: Attractive, black colored, nonstick silicone coating is very easy to clean. Food won't stick to the masher like metal, rubber or plastic models. You can pop it in your dishwasher for thorough cleaning and you are all set to go for the next round of mashing. Great utensil for mashing avocado or banana. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Potato Masher and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this product will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we got you covered. Chances are, you will never need to reach out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JyLlPMJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B08M91D3NP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M91D3NP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M91D3NP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
