window.products.push({"id":270551,"name":"Pyrex (1) 7202-PC Plum Purple, (2) 7200-PC Thistle Purple, (2) 7201-PC Purple, (1) 7402-PC Thistle Purple, (2) 7210-PC Plum Purple, & (1) 7211-PC Dark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61706qj8ZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set includes; Pyrex (1) 7202-PC Plum Purple Lid, & (2) 7200-PC Thistle Purple Lids, & (2) 7201-PC Purple Lids, & (1) 7402-PC Thistle Purple Lid, & (2) 7210-PC Plum Purple Lids, & (1) 7211-PC Dark Blue Lids. These Pyrex lids make cooking, serving and storing convenient and easy - perfect for any occasion. These versatile Pyrex lids are safe for use in the refrigerator, freezer, or microwave and clean up easily on the top rack of the dishwasher. Made of a non-porous surface, these lids will not absorb food odors, flavors, or stains. These lids are made in the USA and are BPA free. Please check the bottom of the dish your trying to cover for a number, then find the corresponding number on the lid to ensure the propper fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61706qj8ZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyrex","source_asin":"B09KF25DFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KF25DFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KF25DFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":270552,"name":"Heka Naturals Polished Shungite Black Crystal Cube | 2 Inch - Decorative Crystal Chakra Decor, Home Decor, Office Decor, Feng Shui Healing Stones Cube","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cZEwNOCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🪷 FROM PHYSICAL TO METAPHYSICAL | From the Freemasons, to Metatron's Cube, this shape is often associated with stability, form, manifestation, prosperity, and security. Limitations, boundaries, and protection are also very strong themes associated with the cube. It has a special place in Sacred Geometry and it's often associated with the number four. Our black crystal Shungite cube is the perfect corner-stone crystal to help you build a stable and prosperous state of wellness and future. 🧘🏽 BRINGS POSITIVITY & BALANCE | Traditionally, people of the Karelia region used Shungite as healing crystals, and protection stones to spread clean vibes. This Shungite black crystal cube can be used as a meditation and ritual aid. The roots of these uses stem from the Qabala, an intense tradition rich with belief, you can study for years and still learn new things. The cube can be understood as a basic foundation for personal growth, spiritual evolution and encourage manifestation. ◼ POWERFUL ELEGANCE | Our black Shungite crystal cube is hand-made by master artisans well experienced in crafting with crystal. Our Shungite crystal cube is ideal to get you immersed in the world of crystals and powerful stones. The cube is considered to provide stability and form. So if you feel like you've been drifting through endless mental space, perhaps a quiet meditation session with this corner-stone will help guide your spirit back to your body and help center you. 🎓 THE SCIENCE BEHIND THE STONE | What does science say about Shungite and Fullerenes? If you're interested to learn more about Shungite and its medical applications, you can do so by searching for the following PMCID with a simple Google search: PMC2676811 | \"Medicinal applications of fullerenes.” This is an article published by the National Center for Biotechnology Information. 🎀 AUTHENTIC GIFT | Made with love and care, this black Shungite crystal cube is a perfect gift for any special person in your life. Shungite has a long history of being gifted as a goodwill token, health, love and perseverance. This cube is no different as gifting Shungite is not only a gift, it's a people to people positivity transfer, it's spirituality incarnate as a healing crystal, mediation and massage cube protection and finally some snazzy home decor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cZEwNOCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heka Naturals","source_asin":"B086BQBF7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086BQBF7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086BQBF7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
