window.products.push({"id":270641,"name":"Radiologist Coffee Mug 11 oz. Perfect Gift for Your Dad, Mom, Boyfriend, Girlfriend, or Friend - Proudly Made in the USA!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EH+onqmCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"\" Creativity: Buy awesome Radiologist coffee mug for the one you know, the one you work with or the one with you are related to! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to express your love and gratitude towards your special one. That special one may be your friend, parent, better half, colleague, your boy or girl friend. It doesn’t a matter. Creative gifts will be liked by all. Best Quality: We will do our best and will supply you with a high quality 11oz ceramic mug printed in the USA. All ceramic cups are dishwasher and microwave safe with with large easy grip handle. The imprinted is printed on both sides of the mug and guaranteed to last. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! Unique and funny: There are only few things that have the power to connect people from all around the world. Coffee is one such thing. This unique Radiologist mug is a great occasion to discuss a lot with just a cup of coffee in our hands. Nothing can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee with some uncommon coffee mugs. So gifting the funny coffee mugs is a great idea to make them remember you with every sip they take. Stylish: Hold a stylish and awesome coffee mug in your hand, you make a stylish statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title Smart, good looking & Radiologist. It doesn't get better than this , add to your collection and show how awesome you are. Memorable: Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and also for all who enjoy the quality of art. When you buy our personalized coffee mug to someone, either they will preserve it to their collections or they will find a cup of coffee for themselves. Whatever it may be they will remember you every morning.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EH+onqmCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Mugs","source_asin":"B01LZDISJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZDISJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZDISJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
