window.products.push({"id":270661,"name":"Cikary Navy Blue Decorative Throw Pillow Covers for Couch Sofa Bed 26x26 Inch (Set of 2)- Farmhouse Cable Knit Sweater Pillow Covers - Large Soft Embo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vqt5o0s7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Embossed Pattern】: Our navy pillow covers feature a beautiful raised pattern on both sides. The Pattern is delicate and contains twisted rope, wheat ears, and wavy stripes. 【Great Texture】: Made of high-quality elastic polyester, the surface of our 26x26 pillow covers is soft and hairless, with a nice texture to the touch. 【Cozy Home Décor】: With a raised pattern reminiscent of a sweater, our sofa pillow covers will add warmth and atmosphere to any space. The charming cable knit design makes them a cozy addition to your decor. 【Hidden Zipper】: Enjoy a polished look with the invisible zippers on one edge of our decorative pillow covers. The zip opening is large enough, making it simple to replace the pillow inserts. 【Easy to clean】: Our toss pillow covers are machine washable, can be cleaned separately in cold water, and either tumble dry on low or hung to dry. NO INSERTS！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vqt5o0s7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cikary","source_asin":"B09GK6178X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GK6178X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GK6178X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":270662,"name":"HALM Glass Straws - 6x 9 inch Reusable Drinking Straws + Plastic-Free Cleaning Brush - Made in Germany - Dishwasher Safe - Eco-Friendly - Straight - P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u5VnlQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY MADE IN GERMANY - We developed a special glass that produces extremely sturdy and stable straws that are also 100% recyclable. HALM glass straws can handle both cold and heat (from -40 F° to 392 F°) so they are safe for the dishwasher, microwave and even freezer. HALM straws are produced and packaged in Germany where all employees receive fair wages and full benefits. GOOD FOR YOU AND THE PLANET - Most glass straws are made of borosilicate glass, which can never be recycled. That's why we decided to develop a different, 100% recyclable, glass straw to truly reduce our footprint. Our straws, cleaning brush and even packaging are 100% plastic-free and therefore BPA-free, meaning no dangerous toxins in your body. Our production facilities are powered by solar panels. GLASS IS BEST - Remember how refreshing soda tastes out of an old-fashioned glass bottle? Only glass straws are completely taste-neutral, unlike metal, bamboo, silicone, paper, stainless steel or plastic. The rounded glass edges, specially designed for HALM straws, ensure safety and an extra-smooth taste. THE SMOOTHIE PRO - Our 9 inch straw works great in your smoothie as well as in any taller glass: Cocktail, Long Drink, Highball, Frappuccino, Tumbler, Cooler or Mason Jar. The solid glass straw also works as the perfect mixing spoon, muddler or cocktail stirrer. Recommended Drinks: Smoothie, Milkshakes, Mojito, Bloody Mary, Dark 'n' Stormy EASY TO CLEAN - Glass straws, just like drinking glasses, can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher. Each set also contains a plastic-free cleaning brush for using at the sink or cleaning on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u5VnlQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HÅLM","source_asin":"B07HNH7BQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNH7BQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNH7BQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
