window.products.push({"id":270694,"name":"Rantizon Silicone Ice Cube Trays, Small Ice Cube Tray 3 Pack-152 Circles&Squares with lid, BPA Free Tiny Ice Cube Tray with Removable Lid and Bin, Cir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718FYHU8HQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality materials: Made of premium silicone and PP material. The small ice cube trays are Bpa-free and pass the food-grade certification. The ice cube tray with lid and bin uses better materials and designs to make the ice trays stronger and more durable, with no worries about chemical smells and white residue. They can withstand long-term low-temperature storage without breaking. No longer worry about breaking easily. Small Ice Cube Trays 3 Pack: The tiny ice cube tray includes 33 grids round & 104 grids round & 15 grids square with an ice bucket and ice scoop. Ice buckets can hold about 1248 mini ice balls which can make more than 20 cups of cold drinks. Plus, the circle ice cube tray includes a super convenient scoop to make serving a breeze. You also can store a box of ice balls in advance in the freezer so that you can enjoy ice drinks at any time. It's a must-have for all your summer bashes! Easy Get Ice Out&Fast Freezing: This tiny ice cube tray comes with a unique design that makes tiny ice easier to get than soft silicone ice cube trays. Simply Twist & Twist the mini ice cube trays. Put the coffee ice cube tray upside- down then you will mini round ice balls! With tiny ice, balls will chill and cool your drink much faster than standard or large ice cube trays so that you can enjoy the sweet cold drinks first sip much quicker. Easy to Use & Dishwasher Safe: Fill the trays with water, cover the lid on, and then slip the trays into the freezer. Besides water, you can fill the ice cube tray silicone with fruits, ice cream, soda, cocktails, whisky, vodka, ice coffee, and wine to customize your favorite flavor. And you can simply put them into your dishwasher after use. Enjoy Fun Treats: The ice cube tray and bin can be used for more than making ice cubes for your cold drinks. You can also use them to store frozen herbs, garlic cubes, mini coffee cubes, or baby food puree. They are also ideal for making hard candy, chocolate bites, and homemade dog treats. Silicone ice cube tray kits are great for home, parties, bars, gifts, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718FYHU8HQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rantizon","source_asin":"B0BVTTVQX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVTTVQX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVTTVQX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
