window.products.push({"id":270831,"name":"Garland-with-Lights Decorations Lighted-Birch-Garland Decor Table-White-Tree-Party-Mantle-Indoor-Outdoor Decorations 6FT 48LED Vines-with-Lights for T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xjyPlr8HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Fabric 🎄 [ EASY TO SET UP ] This lighted birch garland is very easy to set up and use - only need to open the battery compartment, put in 3 AA batteries, and finally press the control button on the battery compartment. The garland is very flexible and soft. You can put it anywhere or make it surrounding anything you like. 🎄 [ ADD A SEASONAL TOUCH AND SOFT LIGHT ] Equipped with 48pcs small LED beads, this garland with lights generates very warm and soft light, which adds a lovely and seasonal touch. Especially, if you’re a lover of Scandinavian style, this lighted birch garland you can’t miss! 🎄 [ BATTERY OPERATED GARLAND] The lighted birch garland is powered by 3x AA batteries (not included). So it can be taken to anywhere for use, especially for outdoor decorations, gatherings, etc. Both non-rechargeable batteries and rechargeable batteries can be used. But we strongly recommend to use rechargeable batteries to save costs. 🎄 [ SAFE TO USE ] The lighted garland is powered by 3x AA batteries (not included). So it’s super safe for kids and pets. You’ll never worry about kids or pets getting shocked. 🎄 [ TWIGS CAN BE RESHAPED AS YOU WISH ] The wigs of this lighted birch garland are very flexible and durable. They can be reshaped at your will without broken. Perfect decorations for mantles, fireplaces, tables, cupboards, stairs, etc. 🎄 [ PERFECT ROOM DECOR ] This lighted garland decoration can be used for bedrooms, Christmas, parties, Valentine's Day, weddings, home, windows, bathrooms, festivals, holidays, shows, restaurants, hotels, commercial buildings, shopping centers and more. 🎄 [ RAINPROOF LED BIRCH LIGHTS ] The whole fairy string lights are rainproof, including lights, wires, battery box and control button. So it’s worry-free when they’re used outside, especially in bad weathers. 🎄 [ NO ASSEMBLY REQUIRED ] There’s no assembly required for this lighted birch garland. All you need to do is just put 3x AA batteries into the compartment and press the control button.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xjyPlr8HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTAVILEM","source_asin":"B09T5XN3LV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T5XN3LV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T5XN3LV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
