window.products.push({"id":270837,"name":"Fall Walkway by Lois Bryan, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5ljwF5TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a walkway through fall trees. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'..ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5ljwF5TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKH5YKI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKH5YKI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKH5YKI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
