window.products.push({"id":270867,"name":"Fuller Brush Kitchen Cleaning Brush Set with Wood Handles, 4-piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hKg1c+krL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Fuller Brush Kitchen Cleaning Brush Set is made of the same high quality and durability that has made this American company a household name in cleaning solutions for more than a century. One all-inclusive set includes every size for deep cleaning. With sturdy twisted wire construction and durable, stiff nylon bristles, these heavy-duty cleaning brushes are the ideal shapes and sizes to remove dirt and grime. Bottle/jar brush fits through narrow openings to clean interiors of tall bottles, jars and vases. Dish brush scrubs contours of pots and pans. Vegetable brush scrubs potatoes, carrots, beets and turnips. The ergonomic, rounded natural wood handles on these cleaning brushes fit comfortably in the hand for stressless cleaning. The bristles of each kitchen cleaning brush retain shape, even with tough daily use. All-purpose brush efficiently works beyond the kitchen to clean planters, outdoor furniture and gear. Made in the USA. From the beginning in 1906, the Fuller Brush Company has upheld their high standards of commitment to the customer by providing reliable, superior-quality cleaning products for the home. Set includes: All-purpose brush Bottle/jar brush Dish brush Vegetable brush Product Features All-inclusive set of 4 durable cleaning brushes -- all-purpose, bottle/jar, dish and vegetable Sturdy twisted wire construction and stiff nylon bristles that retain shape for deep cleaning All-purpose brush removes dirt and grim from surfaces Bottle/jar brush fits through narrow openings to clean interiors of tall bottles, jars and vases Dish brush scrubs contours of pots and pans Vegetable brush for root vegetables Ergonomic natural wood handles provides a comfortable grip Work beyond the kitchen to clean planters, outdoor furniture and gear An American icon since 1906, the Fuller Brush Company has more than 100 years of experience in providing quality, durable cleaning supplies for the home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hKg1c+krL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuller Brush","source_asin":"B00MOJLCT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-270867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MOJLCT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MOJLCT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
